OL,3,GNEWSAMP backs town's proposed balaclava
OL,4,Aban
OL,5,
OL,6,FMansfield could follow other towns and
OL,7,Fcities by introducing a ban on
OL,8,Fbalaclavas ban after leaders expressed
OL,9,Ftheir interest in the move.
OL,11,FSteve Yemm, Labour MP for the town, has
OL,12,Fconfirmed he is in favour and council
OL,13,Ftalks about the move are ongoing.
OL,15,FIt comes after Nottingham became one of
OL,16,Fthe first cities in the UK to introduce
OL,17,Fa ban on balaclavas in September,
OL,18,Fgiving authorities powers to demand
OL,19,Fface coverings are removed and issue
OL,20,Ffines if they "reasonably believe" they
OL,21,Fare being used to commit crime or
OL,22,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
